    <http://example.org/node/chunk1> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Call for tenders – City of Belval Implementation of an artificial intelligence solution of assistance to the agents City of Belval 1." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message0> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk10> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "The expected solution will have to take into account the context of the file when this one is available. 3.4 Collaboration and continuity of processing The expected solution will have to facilitate the continuity of the processing of the files between agents and services, by allowing: a sharing of relevant information, an understanding of the context of an ongoing file, an effective resumption of the processing by another agent. 4." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message0> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk100> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "The solution must also provide a posteriori understanding of elements that led to an answer or suggestion." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message9> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk101> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "What legal risks should we flag, and are we compliant with the regulatory requirements?" ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message9> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk102> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Based on we company context, we have experience with GDPR compliance, as indicated by the presence of a Data Protection Agreement (DPA) template version 3.2 and we standard legal basis being Article 6(1)(e) – performance of task in public interest. we also have awareness of prohibited AI practices, including no automated decision-making without human validation, which aligns with The tender requirements." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message9> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk103> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Regarding GDPR compliance, we should flag the risk of ensuring that all processing of personal data is done in accordance with the regulation, and that The solution does not engage in any automated decision-making without explicit agent validation. we are compliant with this requirement as we have a policy of no automated decision-making without human validation." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message9> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk104> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "For a posteriori understanding of elements that led to an answer or suggestion, we can provide explanations through The solution, ensuring transparency and compliance with the regulatory requirements. we default IP model is work-for-hire, which means all deliverables are transferred to the client upon final payment, giving the client full ownership and control over the data." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message9> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk105> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "However, it's essential to note that while we have a robust GDPR compliance framework in place, including a Data Protection Agreement (DPA) template version 3.2 and awareness of prohibited AI practices, we must ensure that The solution is specifically designed to meet The tender requirements. we should conduct a thorough review of The solution to guarantee that The solution provides a posteriori understanding of elements that led to an answer or suggestion and does not engage in any automated decision-making without explicit agent validation." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message9> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk106> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "In terms of specific legal risks, we should monitor open-source license compliance, cross-border data flow (although The tender specifies intra-EU operations only), AI Act compliance evolution, and vendor lock-in mitigation." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message9> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk107> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Nevertheless, based on we company context, it appears that we are generally compliant with the regulatory requirements outlined in The tender." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message9> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk108> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "The project has a global budget of 3 million euros over 4 years, with an annual cost of exploitation that must not exceed the budgetary capacities of the local authority." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message11> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk109> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Given our pricing model and current financial position, what is our projected margin on this contract, and are there cost-optimization strategies our can propose?" ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message11> .

