        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message0> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk5> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "General description of the need The expected solution will have to allow to provide to the agents an intelligent assistance tool, accessible from the agents work environment, capable of accompanying the agents in the agents administrative activities. an intelligent assistance tool, accessible from their work environment, capable of accompanying them in their administrative activities could notably bear on: the search for information in the internal procedures and the applicable regulation, the help with the drafting of letters or of answers to the users, the accompaniment in the instruction of files (town planning, social aids, civil status, etc.), the suggestion of actions or of steps to realize in the framework of an administrative process." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message0> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk50> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "To this title: the hosting will have to be realized on an infrastructure of SecNumCloud type or equivalent, a particular attention will be brought to the dependence vis-à-vis non-European suppliers. 7." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message0> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk51> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Budgetary constraints The global budget allocated to the project is estimated at 3 million euros over a duration of 4 years." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message0> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk52> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "The annual cost of exploitation will have to remain mastered and compatible with the budgetary capacities of the local authority." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message0> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk53> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "The holder will have to propose an approach allowing to optimize the costs while guaranteeing the quality of service expected. 8." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message0> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk54> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Environmental constraints In the framework of City of Belval policy of sustainable development, City of Belval wishes to limit the environmental footprint of City of Belval systems of information." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message0> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk55> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "The holder will have to propose a solution contributing to the reduction of the energetic consumption and relying, as much as possible, on infrastructures with low carbon impact. 9." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message0> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk56> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Modalities of deployment the project will have to be conducted in a progressive manner, with: a pilot phase on a limited scope, a progressive generalization to the entirety of the services." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message0> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk57> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "An accompaniment to the change and actions of training of the agents will be expected. 10." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message0> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk58> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Criteria of evaluation of the offers the offers will be evaluated with regard to the following criteria: quality and relevance of the proposed solution, compliance to the regulatory requirements, level of security, global cost of the proposed solution, taking into account of the environmental issues, capacity of innovation." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message0> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk59> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "The project has a global budget of 3 million euros over 4 years, with an annual cost of exploitation that must not exceed the budgetary capacities of the local authority." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message3> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk6> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "The expected solution will have to integrate The expected solution into the existing practices of the agents and not constitute a rupture in the agents modes of work. 3." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message0> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk60> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "The solution must be deployed through a progressive deployment pilot phase and generalization." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message3> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk61> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Given our company's PM methodologies, past public sector references, consortium partners, available capacity, and governance practices as of 2024, what are the key project coordination activities our company's need to undertake to ensure successful delivery?" ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message3> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk62> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "To ensure successful delivery of The project within the given budget and timeframe, our company's will undertake several key project coordination activities." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message3> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk63> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Firstly, our company's will utilize our company's established project management methodologies, including PRINCE2, Agile Scrum, and SAFe, to plan and execute The project." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message3> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk64> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Given The project duration of 4 years and The project complexity, a hybrid approach combining the structure of PRINCE2 with the flexibility of Agile Scrum may be suitable." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message3> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk65> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Secondly, our company's will draw on our company's past experience in delivering public sector projects, such as the digital workplace transformation for Comune di Torino and the AI-powered document management system for Regione Lombardia." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message3> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk66> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "These references demonstrate our company's ability to manage large-scale public sector projects and deliver large-scale public sector projects successfully." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message3> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk67> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Thirdly, considering a global budget of 3 million euros over 4 years and the need for progressive deployment, our company's will work closely with our company's consortium partners, such as EuroCloud Solutions S.A., LexIA GmbH, and GreenCompute S.r.l., to leverage our consortium partners, such as EuroCloud Solutions S.A., LexIA GmbH, and GreenCompute S.r.l. expertise in areas like sovereign cloud hosting, legal AI, and green IT. work will help optimize costs while ensuring high-quality service delivery." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message3> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk68> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Fourthly, given our company's available project management capacity of 60% as of 2024, our company's will allocate sufficient resources to The project, ensuring that The project is adequately staffed and managed throughout The project lifecycle." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message3> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk69> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Lastly, our company's will implement our company's governance practices, including maintaining a RAID log, decision log, and change request process, as well as establishing a steering committee." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message3> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk7> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Functional scope The expected solution will have to cover the following functionalities: 3.1 Assistance with the consultation of information The expected solution will have to allow the agents to access quickly to reliable and up-to-date information coming from: the internal procedures, the applicable regulatory texts, the internal documents (guides, notes, repositories)." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message0> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk70> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "This governance structure will facilitate effective communication, issue resolution, and decision-making, ultimately contributing to The project success." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message3> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk71> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "By undertaking these key project coordination activities, our company's is confident in our company's ability to deliver The project within the specified budget and timeframe while meeting the client's requirements and expectations." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message3> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk72> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "The solution must integrate with existing business software (civil status, town planning, electronic document management systems - EDM), user directories, and APIs." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message5> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk73> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "The solution must also guarantee a high level of availability (99.9%) and a response time of less than 2 seconds." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message5> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk74> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Hosting must be on SecNumCloud-certified infrastructure within the EU, with no dependency on non-European suppliers." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message5> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk75> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Can our current technology stack meet these requirements, and what architecture do our propose?" ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message5> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk76> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Based on our company context, our have experience with integrating APIs, which can be used to connect with existing business software such as civil status, town planning, and electronic document management systems (EDM). our expertise in API integration includes REST, GraphQL, SOAP, and CMIS standards. our also have experience with API gateways like Kong and Apigee." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message5> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk77> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "For the high availability requirement of 99.9%, our performance benchmarks indicate that our can achieve an availability of 99.92% on past projects, which is close to the required threshold." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message5> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk78> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "To further improve achieve, our could leverage our experience with containerization using Docker and Kubernetes (K8s) to ensure efficient resource utilization and scalability." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message5> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk79> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Regarding response time, our typical performance benchmark for RAG p95 response time is 1800 ms, which exceeds the less than 2-second requirement." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message5> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk8> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "The expected solution will have to be in measure to contextualize the answers in function of the demand of the agent. 3.2 Assistance with the drafting The expected solution will have to propose a help with the drafting of administrative contents, notably: answers to the users, administrative letters, syntheses of files." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message0> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk80> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "However, our can explore optimization techniques such as quantization methods like INT8 or INT4 (GPTQ) to improve inference speeds." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message5> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk81> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "For hosting on SecNumCloud-certified infrastructure within the EU, our experience with cloud providers includes OVHcloud and Scaleway, both of which are EU-based and could potentially meet the SecNumCloud certification requirements. our also have experience with Outscale (SecNumCloud), which directly meets this requirement." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message5> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk82> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "To minimize dependency on non-European suppliers, our can focus on using open-source or European-based solutions for our current technology stack. our existing expertise in AI/ML systems, cloud architecture, and data engineering can be leveraged to design a solution that meets these requirements." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message5> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk83> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "The proposed architecture could involve deploying our AI model on a SecNumCloud-certified infrastructure provider like Outscale (SecNumCloud), which directly meets this requirement, utilizing containerization with Docker and Kubernetes (K8s) (K8s) for scalability and efficiency. our would integrate our solution with the existing business software using APIs, ensuring compliance with the required standards." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message5> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk84> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Additionally, our can implement monitoring tools like Prometheus and Grafana to ensure high availability and response times are met." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message5> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk85> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "While our current technology stack can meet many of these requirements, careful planning and optimization will be necessary to ensure all conditions are fully satisfied." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message5> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk86> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "The solution must comply with regulatory and legal constraints, including GDPR, and ensure data protection (encryption, anonymization if necessary) within the European Union." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message7> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk87> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "The solution must also guarantee explicability and transparency of recommendations or proposals." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message7> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk88> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "What security controls and compliance measures should we implement to meet these requirements?" ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message7> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk89> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "To meet the requirements of complying with regulatory and legal constraints, including GDPR, ensuring data protection, and guaranteeing explicability and transparency, our company, Nexus Engineering S.r.l., can implement several security controls and compliance measures based on we existing capabilities." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message7> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk9> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "The generated contents will have to be adapted to the administrative context and compliant with the requirements of quality expected. 3.3 Assistance with the instruction of files The expected solution will have to be in measure to assist the agents in the analysis and the processing of files, by: proposing relevant information, recalling the applicable rules, suggesting actions or verifications to carry out." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message0> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk90> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Firstly, as we are already GDPR compliant and have a Data Protection Officer (DPO) appointed, with contact information available at dpo@nexus-engineering.it, we can ensure that all data processing activities comply with the GDPR regulations. we standard data residency is within the European Union, which aligns with the requirement of not transferring data outside the European Union." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message7> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk91> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "For data protection, we can utilize we anonymisation tools, including Microsoft Presidio (self-hosted) and custom NER models, to ensure that personal data is protected through anonymization if necessary. we also enforce encryption for data protection, although the specific encryption methods are not detailed in we context, we do have experience with secure practices." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message7> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk92> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "To guarantee explicability and transparency of recommendations or proposals, especially in the context of artificial intelligence solutions, we can leverage we capabilities in providing understandable outputs from we AI systems." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message7> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk93> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "While our context does not explicitly mention explainable AI techniques, we focus on security and compliance suggests that we would prioritize transparent and explainable AI models to meet regulatory requirements." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message7> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk94> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Additionally, as an ISO 27001 certified company with a scope that includes the design, development, and operation of AI-powered information systems, we can ensure that we information security management system (ISMS) is robust and aligned with international standards." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message7> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk95> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "This certification expires on November 30, 2026, ensuring we commitment to information security over time. we experience with regulatory frameworks such as RGPD/GDPR, EU AI Act, RGS v2 (ANSSI), SecNumCloud, NIS2 Directive, and eIDAS further enhances we capability to comply with legal and regulatory constraints." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message7> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk96> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Specifically, we knowledge of RGS v2 (ANSSI) SecNumCloud framework can help in ensuring that cloud-based solutions are secure and compliant." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message7> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk97> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Lastly, we incident response capabilities, including having a Security Incident Response Team (SIRT) in place, playbooks available for various scenarios, and regular drills (semi-annual), ensure that we are prepared to handle any security incidents promptly and effectively, minimizing the impact on data protection and service continuity." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message7> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk98> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "In summary, by leveraging we GDPR compliance, data anonymization tools, encryption capabilities, ISO 27001 certification, experience with regulatory frameworks, and incident response preparedness, we can implement robust security controls and compliance measures to meet the client's requirements regarding regulatory compliance, data protection, and explicability/transparency of AI-driven recommendations within the European Union." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message7> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk99> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "The tender requires strict GDPR compliance, with no automated decision-making without explicit agent validation." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message9> .

